ers-raptor.png", "id": "1445954297670766", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620532_1445954301004099_4334922826542964934_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5-hG33Uhl2UQ7kNvwGJ48Km&_nc_oc=Adoz4a0Szh5sdgYwjuX307GXEsgZpmq_yivQ5Bp-h20fsaZAirsME4kgvMVBgCjcqNo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR8Uq3XewJ4MFBR9ysq6BN37n0ch6_l5d2jiW6jYp-kCw&oe=6B0B183C"}, {"file_name": "05-sanctuary-pearl-hole-pov.png", "id": "1024895080652578", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623585_1024895083985911_7527913330202176631_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4Y0NRmA6UYwQ7kNvwHLvpZO&_nc_oc=AdqK0IY-sUvQvXNRkC2PRcohwJFqY3pt2wxkkSmZ2pPY0xSM0JFCyrPBtDIIRJ4Tz_0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTMuCEu4qOgfwRoeOQ5onT_RaU89n9C4wtUn8gL1BD_8g&oe=6B0B10EE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover-2560x1440.png", "id": "1671715101338051", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623111_1671715104671384_5875727415432959553_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WTsWda-X3U0Q7kNvwGdrHKH&_nc_oc=AdposUKNHQJ9i9wWAmnhT0RDA5sSezBEqN_sHHi8WsxzL_i80C_81v1UblOqx1jGtzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSYj-KDTcl2l6rgjAuzjhHHJcV1TrHjC4lAvu97cHNZkA&oe=6B0B2433"}, "display_name": "Crazy Golf VR", "keywords": ["Golf", "Dinosaurs", "MiniGolf", "Multiplayer", "Coop"], "long_description": "Crazy Golf VR turns mini golf into an adventure. Every course is a race to the hole: take as many strokes as you like, dodge the dinosaurs and chase your fastest time.\n\n**Six wild courses**\n- Putt through woodland meadows, alpine slopes, red-rock canyons, a glowing crystal cavern, rivers of lava and a sunken sanctuary on the ocean floor.\n- Raptors prowl the fairways and pterodactyls circle overhead. Fend them off with a plunger gun, and ring bronze gongs to lower the drawbridges.\n- New to golf? A guided Introduction teaches you to swing, move and shoot.\n\n**Play together**\n- Co-op: two to four players share one ball and race the clock together.\n- 2v2 team race: one ball per team, and the first team to the hole wins.\n- Two clubhouses, a moonlit city rooftop and a sunrise lakeside valley, host up to six players with voice chat and driving ranges for long-drive contests.\n- Invite friends and join their games in a click.\n\n**Compete and collect**\n- World leaderboards for every course's fastest time and each range's longest drive.\n- 13 achievements, each unlocking a title for your name tag.\n- Pick your cap colour, and finish the campaign to unlock a cat companion.\n\n**Play your way**\n- Teleport or smooth movement, snap or smooth turning, a comfort vignette and a seated mode.", "short_description": "Mini golf meets a dinosaur adventure. Race to the hole across six wild courses, solo or with up to three friends, and keep the raptors at bay with your trusty plunger gun."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.avivarma.ca/Crazy-Golf-VR/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.avivarma.ca/Crazy-Golf-VR/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Harshvardhan Varma", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.avivarma.ca/Crazy-Golf-VR/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKI